        "alt": "朝のカジノカフェの背景"
      },
      {
        "id": "main.s1.w03.asset.background.002",
        "kind": "background",
        "path": "/assets/story/bg-arena-reception.png",
        "alt": "闘技場の正面受付の背景"
      },
      {
        "id": "main.s1.w03.asset.sprite.mimi.tsukkomi",
        "kind": "sprite",
        "path": "/assets/story/sprites/mimi-tsukkomi-v1.png",
        "alt": "驚いてツッコミを入れるミミ"
      },
      {
        "id": "main.s1.w03.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "kind": "sprite",
        "path": "/assets/story/sprites/mimi-serious-v1.png",
        "alt": "真剣な表情のミミ"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w03.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w03.asset.sprite.mimi.tsukkomi",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "朝のカフェ、豆を挽く音と湯気でできてる。約束どおりマダムが来た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "風呂敷から、甘い匂い——と、かすかに不穏な赤。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日の目当ては、詫びより情報。名義のこと、選手のこと、負債のこと。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "聞きたいことを三つ、ゆうべ紙に書いてきた。準備は接客の基本のはず。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "包みが開く。コロシアム銘菓「八つ裂き大福」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "、登場。断面から、血みたいに赤い苺ソースがとろり。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "隣の剣士さんが、反射で抜刀した。——鳴らす場面、あったじゃないですか。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「あらあら、ごめんなさいねえ。見た目だけなのよ」一口食べる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……悔しい。上品で、おいしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "二個目に手が出た言い訳、まだ考え中。剣士さんも、納刀して二個食べた。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "質問一つ目、闘技場は何ですか。「大きい賭場よねえ」二つ目、オーナー権とは。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「立派な鍵よねえ」三つ目、負債について。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「あら、あるの?」……空振り、三つ。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "マダムは、権利の細部を本人も知らないらしい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「だって、宝くじで当たったんですもの」当たるんだ、闘技場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "メモに、答えの代わりに大福のソースが一滴。今日の収穫、以上。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w03.asset.background.002",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "収穫ゼロで受付へ戻ると、ノノさんが紙を出して待っていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「オーナーさん、これだけは先に」選手登録票。真ん中に「本人署名」の欄。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「この署名が無いと、どんな伝説でも出場できません」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「オーナーにできるのは、お願いするところまでです」つまり、口説くのだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "権利で人は動かせない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.008d",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.008d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……動かせない方で、少し安心した。動かせる方が、怖い。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "そこへ受付から封書。「初心者大会のご招待(暫定オーナー様向け)」参加は任意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "優勝賞品——温泉旅行、二泊。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "温泉。二泊。湯。耳が、期待でぴこぴこ動いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この数日の疲れが、その二文字に吸い寄せられる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "気づけば参加要項を三回読んでた。三回とも、賞品の欄から。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「初心者大会、いいですよ。相手は普通のモンスターです」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「操作を覚えるための大会ですから。……あの、目が真剣です」真剣にもなる。湯、だもの。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "出よう。出たい。でも選手が三人要る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.012b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.012b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この街で知り合った顔ぶれは、まだ数えるほど。全員、明らかに普通じゃない。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.direction.mimi.shift.013",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w03.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.013a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.013a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "それでも頼みに行くと決めた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.013b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.013b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "大福の残りを包み直す。差し入れは、交渉の基本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.line.013c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w03.line.013c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "カジノで覚えた、数少ない正しい知識。よし。——口説くぞ、伝説。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "main.s1.w03.choice.001",
          "label": "温泉に行きたいんです、と正直に頼む",
          "result": "正直、意外と強かった。「温泉のために戦う……新しい」と、妙に感心された。動機を飾らない監督で、少し有名に。理由は選べない。大福も一個減ってた。交渉成立、ってことで。",
          "intent": "動機を飾らず、そのまま渡す",
          "promise": "正直さが顔になる代わりに、目的が温泉だと街に知れ渡る",
          "memory": "「温泉のために戦う」という評判が、先に歩き出している",
          "tone": "wild",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "sharedPoints",
              "amount": 2
            }
          ],
          "goto": "main.s1.w03.node.end.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "main.s1.w03.choice.002",
          "label": "お仕事として、条件から聞いて回る",
          "result": "条件から聞くと、面接みたいになった。出場数、苦手なこと、呼ばれたい名前。「先に聞かれたのは初めてだ」と言われた。長く生きた人の初めてを、一つ引き受けてしまった。責任、たぶん温泉より重い。",
          "intent": "本人の条件を先に聞き、選べる形で頼む",
          "promise": "信頼の土台ができる代わりに、聞いた条件には責任が生まれる",
          "memory": "「条件を先に聞かれたのは初めて」という言葉が残っている",
          "tone": "pragmatic",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "sharedPoints",
              "amount": 2
            }
          ],
          "goto": "main.s1.w03.node.end.001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s1.w03.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
    "status": "review",
    "sourceDocument": "docs/MAIN_STORY_SCRIPT.md",
    "authorNote": "語り口V2・二行枠で改稿。週3(増量版13行)。仕組み学習=選手登録は本人署名(勧誘の作法。週22の遠い根)。三つの質問の空振り→窓口の一枚で答が出る構成。剣士の抜刀=週1の天丼。",
    "legacyGeneratedIds": false
  }
}
